=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data (web useTranslation + getChatSuggestions() const): bound through the P1/S8 seam
    SuggestedPromptsSource→SuggestedPromptsModel. The const is ported VERBATIM as
    SuggestedPromptsCatalog.defaults (4 entries, same keys/defaults/order); the projection
    maps any [ChatSuggestion] the source delivers, so the web doc-comment's "swap in a
    backend-fed endpoint later without touching the component shape" drops in unchanged.
    onPick(text) preserved as the view callback (parent fills + focuses input, no auto-submit).
    No HTTP in the view.
  - Composition (web <ul flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center max-w-2xl mx-auto> + ghost
    Button chips with the Sparkles icon):
      • strip   -> SuggestedPromptsFlowLayout (wraps + centers each row; capped at
                   max-w-2xl = 672pt and centered via mx-auto).
      • chip    -> SuggestedPromptChip: continuous Capsule, surface fill + border stroke,
                   sparkle glyph in chartSeriesPower (the brand purple == web purple-500),
                   pressed → purple border (web hover:border-purple-500/30). Real Button so
                   VoiceOver / Full-Keyboard-Access / pointer hover all work.
      • title   -> the web title lives ONLY on the <ul> aria-label ("Suggested prompts");
                   reproduced as the container accessibilityLabel (invisible), so the
                   healthy state is exactly the web's chrome-free centered chip strip.
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a unit test):
      loading (skeleton capsules in the same flow layout) · empty (ContentUnavailableView —
      the future backend-fed "no suggestions" case, never a blank box) · error (Retry, web
      QueryError peer) · content (the chip strip) · stale (freshness chip + "suggestions may
      be stale" banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the transition) · offline (offline chip +
      "showing saved suggestions" banner, cached chips kept visible).
  - i18n (P1/S10): web keys preserved VERBATIM — chatbot.suggestion.{fleetYesterday,
    chargingCost30d,socDropping,efficientDrive} + the aria-label chatbot.aria.suggestions
    ("Suggested prompts"); native chrome namespaced chatbot.suggestion.{hint,stale,offline,
    staleBanner,offlineBanner,refresh,loading,empty,errorTitle,retry}. Every code-referenced
    key is declared in SuggestedPrompts.strings; NO English string literals in native code
    (all via SuggestedPromptsStrings facade + Text(verbatim:)).
  - Accessibility: each chip carries a VoiceOver label (the prompt text) + hint ("Inserts
    this prompt into the message field" — explains the web no-auto-submit behaviour) +
    .isButton; the container is labeled "Suggested prompts"; freshness chip / banner /
    refresh are labeled; sparkle + warning glyphs are accessibilityHidden; Dynamic-Type
    system fonts (Font.TS) with multi-line chips (fixedSize vertical); reduce-motion honored
    (TSFadeIn + a static press-opacity, no animated press).
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): SuggestedPromptsModel.start() emits view.opened with the surface
    slug "SuggestedPrompts" exactly once (OSLogSuggestedPromptsTelemetry default; prod app
    injects the shared diagnostics adapter). Asserted green by SpySuggestedPromptsTelemetry.

